          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Sample size for a proportion: $n = \\dfrac{z_{\\alpha/2}^2\\,\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})}{E^2}$. With 99% confidence, $z_{0.005} = 2.58$, $\\hat{p} = 0.6$, $E = 0.2$: $n = \\dfrac{2.58^2 \\times 0.6 \\times 0.4}{0.2^2} = \\dfrac{6.6564 \\times 0.24}{0.04} = 39.94$. Sample size is ALWAYS rounded UP, so $n = 40$. The distractor 39 comes from rounding down.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Cỡ mẫu cho tỷ lệ: $n = \\dfrac{z_{\\alpha/2}^2\\,\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})}{E^2}$. Với độ tin cậy 99%, $z_{0.005} = 2.58$, $\\hat{p} = 0.6$, $E = 0.2$: $n = \\dfrac{2.58^2 \\times 0.6 \\times 0.4}{0.2^2} = \\dfrac{6.6564 \\times 0.24}{0.04} = 39.94$. Cỡ mẫu LUÔN làm tròn LÊN, nên $n = 40$. Đáp án nhiễu 39 do làm tròn xuống.</p></div>"
