          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\hat{p}_1 = \\dfrac{13}{111} = 0.11712$, $\\hat{p}_2 = \\dfrac{23}{190} = 0.12105$. Pooled proportion $\\bar{p} = \\dfrac{13 + 23}{111 + 190} = \\dfrac{36}{301} = 0.11960$. Then $SE = \\sqrt{\\bar{p}(1-\\bar{p})\\left(\\dfrac{1}{111} + \\dfrac{1}{190}\\right)} = \\sqrt{0.10530 \\times 0.014272} = 0.03877$, and $z = \\dfrac{0.11712 - 0.12105}{0.03877} = \\dfrac{-0.00394}{0.03877} = -0.102$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\hat{p}_1 = \\dfrac{13}{111} = 0.11712$, $\\hat{p}_2 = \\dfrac{23}{190} = 0.12105$. Tỷ lệ gộp $\\bar{p} = \\dfrac{13 + 23}{111 + 190} = \\dfrac{36}{301} = 0.11960$. Khi đó $SE = \\sqrt{\\bar{p}(1-\\bar{p})\\left(\\dfrac{1}{111} + \\dfrac{1}{190}\\right)} = \\sqrt{0.10530 \\times 0.014272} = 0.03877$, và $z = \\dfrac{0.11712 - 0.12105}{0.03877} = \\dfrac{-0.00394}{0.03877} = -0.102$.</p></div>"
